shape: sequence_diagram

C: {
  label: Client
}
S: {
  label: Temporal\nServer
}
W: {
  label: Workflow\nWorker
}
S.style: {
  fill: "#B664FF"
  font-color: "#EEEEEE"
}

C.1 -> S: Update that\nexecutes an\nActivity
W -> S.1: poll
S.1 -> W.1: Update
W.1 -> S: Update Accepted
W.1."Update handler\n\nActivityScheduled\n...Activity Worker...\nActivityCompleted"
W.1 -> S.3: Update Completed
S.3 -> C.1: Update Completed
C."Client knows Activity is done\nand has Activity result"
